{"metadata":{"title":"macOS 发布流程","modules":[{"name":"OrzMC"}],"roleHeading":"","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"发布前准备","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%89%8D%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"钥匙串中已安装 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Developer ID Application"},{"type":"text","text":" 证书。"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已创建 Apple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notarytool"},{"type":"text","text":" 钥匙串配置。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"已准备 Sparkle EdDSA 私钥，可以存放在钥匙串或文件中。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"可选：GitHub CLI 已登录，用于上传 Release 资产。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"首次创建 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notarytool"},{"type":"text","text":" 配置："}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["xcrun notarytool store-credentials \"orzmc-notary\" \\","  --apple-id \"APPLE_ID_EMAIL\" \\","  --team-id \"2N62934Y28\" \\","  --password \"APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD\""],"syntax":"bash"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83","text":"一条命令发布"},{"syntax":"bash","code":["NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary \\",".\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本会从 "},{"code":"OrzMC\/Configuration\/Config.xcconfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 读取 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MARKETING_VERSION"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION"},{"text":"，然后生成：","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"dist\/macos\/<version>-<build>\/...zip","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"：用于 Sparkle 更新。"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"dist\/macos\/<version>-<build>\/...dmg","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"：用于直接下载。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"products\/appcast.xml"},{"type":"text","text":"：用于 Sparkle 更新源。"}]}]}]},{"text":"运行要求","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"当前公开 macOS 版本要求："}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"macOS 14.0 Sonoma 或更新版本。","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple Silicon 或 Intel Mac。"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"首次获取版本清单、下载资源和 Sparkle 更新需要网络连接。"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"启动所选 Minecraft Java Edition 版本需要兼容的 JDK。应用会检测已安装 JDK 的主版本，并可在需要时下载匹配版本。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"维护时需要保持以下位置一致："}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrzMC.xcodeproj\/project.pbxproj"},{"text":" 中的 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET = 14.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"products\/appcast.xml"},{"type":"text","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sparkle:minimumSystemVersion"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"DocC 中面向用户的安装要求说明","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"常用选项","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9"},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["DEVELOPER_ID_APPLICATION=\"Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)\"","APPLE_TEAM_ID=TEAMID","NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary","SPARKLE_ED_KEY_FILE=\/path\/to\/sparkle_private_key","RELEASE_NOTES_FILE=\/path\/to\/release-notes.md","PUBLISH_GITHUB=1","DERIVED_DATA_PATH=DerivedData"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"仅做本地打包验证、不进行公证："}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["SKIP_NOTARIZE=1 .\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"],"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKIP_NOTARIZE=1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 只用于本地验证。公开下载的构建必须完成公证并装订公证票据。"}]},{"text":"GitHub Release 上传","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"GitHub-Release-%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"默认情况下，脚本只准备本地产物并更新 appcast。要上传 Release 资产："}]},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["PUBLISH_GITHUB=1 \\","NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE=orzmc-notary \\",".\/scripts\/release-macos.sh"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"默认仓库是 "},{"code":"OrzMC\/OrzMCApp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"，默认发布标签是 "},{"code":"MARKETING_VERSION","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"，与现有 appcast URL 保持一致。"}]},{"text":"GitHub Actions","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"GitHub-Actions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".github\/workflows\/release-app.yml","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 会调用与本地相同的发布脚本。工作流会导入 Developer ID 证书，复用 DerivedData 和 SwiftPM 缓存，并设置："}]},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["APPLE_TEAM_ID","APPSTORE_PRIVATE_KEY","APPSTORE_KEY_ID","APPSTORE_ISSUER_ID","SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY","GH_TOKEN","DERIVED_DATA_PATH=DerivedData","RESIGN_EXPORTED_APP=1","PUBLISH_GITHUB=1"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CI 公证使用的 "},{"code":"APPSTORE_PRIVATE_KEY","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"code":"SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 都是 Base64 编码后的文件内容。本地发布可以继续使用 "},{"code":"NOTARY_KEYCHAIN_PROFILE","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"code":"SPARKLE_ED_KEY_FILE","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本上传 Release 资产后，工作流会把 "},{"code":"products\/appcast.xml","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 提交回仓库，保持现有 Sparkle 更新源地址可用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Actions 先使用 Xcode 的 Developer ID archive\/export 路径完成导出，然后执行脚本侧二次签名。二次签名会先签内部 dylib、framework、XPC 和子 app，最后对最外层 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".app"},{"type":"text","text":" 做一次 bundle 签名，并追加一次最终 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--deep"},{"type":"text","text":" 签名兜底。排障时可临时设置 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RESIGN_EXPORTED_APP=0"},{"text":" 跳过二次签名，用来区分 Xcode 导出签名与脚本侧重签的差异。","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"脚本侧二次签名默认使用完整的 Developer ID Application 证书名称，而不是 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"security find-identity"},{"type":"text","text":" 返回的 SHA-1 hash。这样与 Xcode archive\/export 的签名身份格式保持一致，也便于发布后通过 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign -d --extract-certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" 复验证书链是否嵌入公开产物。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CI 会把 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEVELOPER_ID_KEYCHAIN"},{"type":"text","text":" 指向导入 Developer ID 证书的临时 keychain。脚本侧重签会把该 keychain 显式传给 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign --keychain"},{"type":"text","text":"，避免 runner 上存在多个 keychain 或同名证书时解析到不完整的签名身份。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Release workflow 固定使用原生 Apple Silicon "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"macos-26"},{"type":"text","text":" runner，并显式选择 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/Applications\/Xcode_26.3.app"},{"type":"text","text":"。当前分发策略继续使用 GitHub hosted CI 产物作为正式 ZIP、DMG 与 Sparkle appcast 来源。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"需要注意：该 runner 产物在本机 macOS 26.4.1 严格复验时曾出现 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Authority=(unavailable)"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist=not bound"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arm64 invalid signature"},{"type":"text","text":"。出于自动化分发需求，当前仍保留 CI 发布链路；每次 CI 发布后仍需下载公开 ZIP\/DMG 做基础复验：校验 sha256、执行 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hdiutil verify"},{"type":"text","text":"、确认 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lipo -archs"},{"type":"text","text":" 包含 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x86_64 arm64"},{"type":"text","text":"，并记录 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"codesign"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spctl"},{"type":"text","text":" 结果。如果用户侧反馈 Gatekeeper 无法打开，再切回本机或 self-hosted macOS 26.4.1 发布。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"缓存 key 包含 "},{"code":"runner.arch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"，避免 Intel 与 Apple Silicon 的 DerivedData、SPM artifact 混用。Intel 兼容性不依赖 runner 架构，而必须在发布验证中确认产物本身保持 "},{"code":"x86_64 arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" universal binary。"}]},{"text":"更新源托管","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%BA%90%E6%89%98%E7%AE%A1"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"应用当前读取的 Sparkle 更新源："}]},{"code":["https:\/\/raw.githubusercontent.com\/OrzMC\/OrzMCApp\/main\/products\/appcast.xml"],"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"这个地址可用，但 GitHub Pages 或 CDN 更适合作为发布基础设施。如果后续迁移更新源 URL，需要更新 ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrzMC\/Common\/Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 中的 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SUFeedURL"},{"text":"，并在大多数用户完成升级前保持旧更新源可访问。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81","text":"发布验证"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"发布脚本会执行：","type":"text"}]},{"code":["codesign --verify --deep --strict --all-architectures","xcrun stapler validate","hdiutil verify","spctl --assess --type execute"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"脚本会校验导出的 app、解包后的 Sparkle ZIP，以及挂载后的 DMG 内部 app，并要求 ","type":"text"},{"code":"codesign -dv --verbose=4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" 输出包含 ","type":"text"},{"code":"Info.plist entries=","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"，拒绝 ","type":"text"},{"code":"codesign -d --entitlements :-","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" 报告的 "},{"code":"invalid entitlements blob","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"，同时要求 Developer ID 签名中能提取到嵌入的证书链。公开构建还需要下载 ZIP\/DMG 到本机复验；如果没有通过这些检查，不要发布。","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"主应用当前没有启用 App Sandbox，也没有需要声明的签名权限，因此 Xcode target 不应配置空的 entitlements 文件。空 entitlements blob 在较新的 macOS 26.4.1 验签环境中会被报告为无效签名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"本项目的完整 macOS 启动器不通过 Mac App Store 分发，而是使用 Developer ID 签名、Apple 公证和 Sparkle 自动更新。","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC\/ReleaseMacOS","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/orzmc\/releasemacos"]}],"references":{"doc://com.joker.OrzMC/documentation/OrzMC":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/orzmc","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.joker.OrzMC\/documentation\/OrzMC","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"OrzMC","role":"collection"}}}